;; Delaware Field Guide — DNS zone file
;; Import at: Cloudflare dashboard → delawarefieldguide.com → DNS → Records
;;             → Import and Export → Import DNS records → upload this file
;;
;; IMPORTANT, in this order:
;;
;;   1. Import this file. Cloudflare imports records PROXIED (orange cloud) by
;;      default — you must switch all five to DNS only (grey cloud) before
;;      going further. Proxying before GitHub has issued its certificate is
;;      what causes the infinite redirect loop.
;;
;;   2. GitHub → repo Settings → Pages → Custom domain →
;;      enter  delawarefieldguide.com  → Save. Wait for the certificate to
;;      provision; the page shows a green tick. This usually takes a few
;;      minutes and can take up to an hour.
;;
;;   3. Tick "Enforce HTTPS" on that same GitHub Pages page. It stays greyed
;;      out until the certificate exists.
;;
;;   4. Only now, if you want Cloudflare's CDN and analytics, switch the four
;;      apex A records and the www CNAME back to Proxied (orange).
;;      Then set SSL/TLS → Overview → mode to FULL (STRICT). Not Flexible.
;;      Flexible + GitHub Pages = infinite redirect loop.
;;
;;   5. Cloudflare will serve stale HTML after each deploy. Either purge the
;;      cache on deploy, or add a Cache Rule bypassing cache for *.html.
;;      Also turn OFF Auto Minify and Rocket Loader — they break the planner.
;;
;; The four A records are GitHub Pages' published apex addresses.
;; https://docs.github.com/en/pages/configuring-a-custom-domain-for-your-github-pages-site

$ORIGIN delawarefieldguide.com.
$TTL 3600

;; Apex → GitHub Pages
@	3600	IN	A	185.199.108.153
@	3600	IN	A	185.199.109.153
@	3600	IN	A	185.199.110.153
@	3600	IN	A	185.199.111.153

;; www → the GitHub Pages host (NOT the apex, and not the repo path)
www	3600	IN	CNAME	werth-code.github.io.

;; No mail on this domain. These two tell the world so, which stops the domain
;; being used to spoof mail from you. Remove them if you ever add email.
@	3600	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 -all"
_dmarc	3600	IN	TXT	"v=DMARC1; p=reject; rua=mailto:matthewwerth@gmail.com"
